---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import LocalAuditChecklist from '../components/infographics/LocalAuditChecklist.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Digital Marketing for Skincare Clinics, Stores & Spas | Unitscalers"
  description="Google Business Profile, local SEO, and website builds for skincare clinics, cosmetic stores, spas, and wellness centers found on Google Maps."
>
  <section class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-24 md:py-32 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight text-brand-dark dark:text-white">
          Marketing for Skincare Clinics, Stores & Spas People Find on Google Maps
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8 max-w-lg">
          Your customers don't search "best skincare agency" — they search "skin clinic near me" or "cosmetics store [city]." If your Google Business Profile is thin, your reviews are outdated, or you're invisible on the map, you're losing walk-ins to a competitor with a better listing, not a better product.
        </p>
        <Button href="/contact-us" variant="primary">Get a Free Google Maps Audit</Button>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 flex items-center justify-center">
        <!-- Abstract Representation of a Map Pin / Local Profile -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm border-2 border-brand-dark dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-black relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 bg-brand-green w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark font-mono font-bold text-brand-dark">#1</div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 mb-2">Location Profile</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mb-2 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Skincare Clinic</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
              <span class="text-yellow-500 text-sm">★★★★★</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">4.9 (128 Reviews)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 pb-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Visibility</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-green-600">High</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 pb-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Bookings</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">+42%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12 text-center text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Who This Is For</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-black p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-dark text-white font-mono text-sm flex items-center justify-center rounded-full mb-4">1</div>
          <p class="font-medium text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">Independent cosmetics and skincare retail stores</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-black p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-dark text-white font-mono text-sm flex items-center justify-center rounded-full mb-4">2</div>
          <p class="font-medium text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">Dermatology and cosmetic clinics with (or planning) their own product line</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-black p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-dark text-white font-mono text-sm flex items-center justify-center rounded-full mb-4">3</div>
          <p class="font-medium text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">Spas and salons with a private-label retail line going unnoticed</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-black p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-dark text-white font-mono text-sm flex items-center justify-center rounded-full mb-4">4</div>
          <p class="font-medium text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">Ayurvedic and wellness clinics with strong local trust but no online visibility</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-black p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 lg:col-span-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-dark text-white font-mono text-sm flex items-center justify-center rounded-full mb-4">5</div>
          <p class="font-medium text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200">Multi-location beauty and wellness chains with fragmented Google Business Profiles</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 text-center text-brand-dark dark:text-white">What We Actually Check in a Google Maps Audit</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        We pull your current ranking position for your category and city, your photo and review count against nearby competitors, and how complete your Google Business Profile is — then show you exactly what's costing you visibility before we talk about anything else.
      </p>
      
      <LocalAuditChecklist />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12 text-center text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Our Services for Local Skincare Businesses</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <Card title="Google Business Profile & Local SEO">
          <p>Getting your clinic, store, or spa to actually show up when someone nearby searches your category — not just existing on the map, but ranking on it.</p>
        </Card>
        
        <Card title="Website Design & Development">
          <p>Many local skincare businesses have no dedicated website — or one that doesn't support online product sales. We build sites that work for walk-in discovery and online retail at once.</p>
        </Card>
        
        <Card title="Reputation & Review Strategy">
          <p>Skincare and wellness customers check reviews before booking or buying. We help you build a genuine, growing review base — never fabricated ratings, which is a known cause of search penalties.</p>
        </Card>
        
        <Card title="Local + Online Growth">
          <p>If you're a multi-outlet spa or clinic group considering an online retail arm, we handle both the local visibility and the D2C build — see our <a href="/digital-brands" class="text-brand-dark dark:text-brand-green font-medium hover:underline">Digital Brands services</a> for what that looks like.</p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-brand-dark dark:bg-gray-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Why a Specialist Agency Matters Here Too</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        A generalist local-SEO agency treats a skincare clinic the same as a plumber or a restaurant. We understand skincare-specific trust signals — dermatologist credentials, ingredient transparency, before/after proof — because it's the only category we work in.
      </p>
      <Button href="/contact-us" variant="secondary">Book a Free Google Maps Audit</Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
